flowchart TD
    accTitle: Billy's live-tested workflow and remaining delivery integration
    accDescr: GLM 5.3 through Vultr Serverless Inference selects bounded tools on the Vultr VM. The tested flow reads company facts, chooses an RFP, reads all extracted proposal pages, saves cited gaps and drafts, and generates an immutable review PDF. NetBird access and approval-bound delivery are planned.
    A["Your request + company profile"] --> B["Billy agent on Vultr VM"]
    B <-->|"Next action / tool results"| M["GLM 5.3 · Vultr Serverless Inference"]
    subgraph V["Saved work on Vultr · bounded tools"]
      B --> C["Compare opportunities + read original RFP"]
      C --> D["Select match + open source in VM browser"]
      D --> E["Ask to upload or reuse a prior response"]
      E --> F["Read every extracted page + cite requirements"]
      F --> G["Save gaps + versioned response sections"]
      G --> H["Discuss missing facts with you"]
      H --> I["Save reported facts + approved follow-ups"]
      I --> G
      G --> P["Immutable review PDF · page count + versions"]
    end
    P --> R["You review · unresolved facts stay visible"]
    R -->|"Request edits"| H
    N["Next: NetBird reviewer access"] -.-> R
    R -.-> S["Next: approve exact version + recipient"]
    S -.-> T["Next: test delivery + recorded result"]
    classDef work fill:#e6ecdf,stroke:#8caa7c,color:#172b29
    classDef human fill:#176349,stroke:#176349,color:#ffffff
    classDef output fill:#fff6df,stroke:#c8ad6d,color:#172b29
    classDef planned fill:#f5f4ee,stroke:#89948b,color:#46554c,stroke-dasharray:5 5
    class B,C,D,F,G,I,M work
    class A,E,H,R human
    class P output
    class N,S,T planned
